limited ONLY to sumti-tails, there might be no ambiguity in forethought 
connection.  Unfortunately I no longer have the capability to check the 
full grammar, much less a modification thereof, since PCYACC, which did the 
meat of the Lojban grammar development, overflows on grammar.300.  But a 
somewhat stripped grammar seems to continue to work with GEK sumti_tail_111 
GIK sumtitail_111.  In any event, with the grammar baselined, it doesn't 
matter.

